#  to satisfy all the constraints, output NO
# .
#
# Otherwise, first output YES
# .
#
# Then, output a string s
#  of length n
# . For 1≤i≤n
# , if you color ai
#  red, si
#  should be R
# . For 1≤i≤n
# , if you color ai
#  blue, si
#  should be B
# .
#
# Example
# InputCopy
# 7
