#  over all test cases does not exceed 2⋅105
# . Similarly, the sum of values m
#  over all test cases does not exceed 2⋅105
# .
#
# Output
# For each test case, output a single number — the maximum k
# , such that the first k
#  characters of a
#  form a subsequence of b
# .
#
# Example
# InputCopy
# 6
# 5 4
# 10011
# 1110
